From: Luissalet <luismasc16@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 00:39:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/36] Install ControlNets and upscalers, and hand them to the
 server

A ControlNet is a context option, not a request field, so which one the
server holds is part of its identity: asking for a different one restarts
it, and asking for none leaves a running server alone.

The adapter also resolves each LoRA name to its file name here, where the
folder was just scanned, and reads the runtime's own parameters line back
out of the returned PNG.

